      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After these things the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came unto Abram in a vision, saying, Fear not, Abram: I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy shield,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy exceeding great reward.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abram said, Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", what wilt thou give me, seeing I go childless, and the steward of my house",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this Eliezer of Damascus?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abram said, Behold, to me thou hast given no seed: and, lo, one born in my house is mine heir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And, behold, the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "came",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "unto him, saying, This shall not be thine heir; but he that shall come forth out of thine own bowels shall be thine heir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he brought him forth abroad, and said, Look now toward heaven, and tell the stars, if thou be able to number them: and he said unto him, So shall thy seed be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he believed in the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; and he counted it to him for righteousness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto him, I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that brought thee out of Ur of the Chaldees, to give thee this land to inherit it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said, Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", whereby shall I know that I shall inherit it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto him, Take me an heifer of three years old, and a she goat of three years old, and a ram of three years old, and a turtledove, and a young pigeon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he took unto him all these, and divided them in the midst, and laid each piece one against another: but the birds divided he not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the fowls came down upon the carcases, Abram drove them away.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the sun was going down, a deep sleep fell upon Abram; and, lo, an horror of great darkness fell upon him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto Abram, Know of a surety that thy seed shall be a stranger in a land",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not theirs, and shall serve them; and they shall afflict them four hundred years;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And also that nation, whom they shall serve, will I judge: and afterward shall they come out with great substance.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou shalt go to thy fathers in peace; thou shalt be buried in a good old age.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But in the fourth generation they shall come hither again: for the iniquity of the Amorites",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not yet full.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, that, when the sun went down, and it was dark, behold a smoking furnace, and a burning lamp that passed between those pieces.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the same day the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "GEN.15.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "GEN.15.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made a covenant with Abram, saying, Unto thy seed have I given this land, from the river of Egypt unto the great river, the river Euphrates:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Kenites, and the Kenizzites, and the Kadmonites,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Hittites, and the Perizzites, and the Rephaims,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Amorites, and the Canaanites, and the Girgashites, and the Jebusites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.15.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
